        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c6e0c73627424a8773ec04878abe54f5.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The camera does not lie, but the truth rarely reveals itself right away. Step into the role of a detective investigating crime scenes in Midnight City, where every detail, trace, and document can change the course of the investigation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the crime scene, you document evidence with your camera, inspect objects up close, and look for details others may have missed. Photos, reports, and notes help reconstruct the course of events, but they do not hand you a ready-made answer. It is up to you which leads you connect and who you ultimately hold responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.poster.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.webm?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.mp4?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The analysis begins back at the office. Review case files, check photos, use the police database, and pin the most important information to the investigation board. A name, address, date, occupation, or brief mention in a report may turn out to be the missing piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something does not add up, you can return to the crime scene and examine it again. Midnight Files focuses on calm investigation, careful observation, and connecting facts instead of leading you straight to the solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: identify the culprit. Each case is a separate investigation with its own victim, crime scene, evidence, and suspects. Sometimes the key lies in a well-taken photo. Sometimes in a single sentence from a report. Sometimes in information hidden deep inside the database.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.poster.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.webm?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.mp4?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is out there. You have to photograph it, check it, connect it, and prove it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/4f979bf1d1b4fbff238cbb8513a7a5df.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir mode</strong> - investigate Midnight City in a black-and-white style inspired by classic detective cinema</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime scene photography</strong> - document evidence with your camera and spot details important to the case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective's notebook</strong> - review discovered evidence, captured photos, and your own notes during the investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation board</strong> - pin photos, reports, notes, and suspects to organize your conclusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police database</strong> - check residents, addresses, events, case files, and connections between pieces of evidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence analysis</strong> - inspect objects, read reports, and search for details that connect people, places, and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the crime scene</strong> - revisit locations when you need to recheck a lead or fill in missing evidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone cases</strong> - each mystery is complete, independent, and built around its own set of clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight City atmosphere</strong> - dark locations, case files, newspapers, photographs, and the classic mood of a crime investigation</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/c6e0c73627424a8773ec04878abe54f5.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The camera does not lie, but the truth rarely reveals itself right away. Step into the role of a detective investigating crime scenes in Midnight City, where every detail, trace, and document can change the course of the investigation.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the crime scene, you document evidence with your camera, inspect objects up close, and look for details others may have missed. Photos, reports, and notes help reconstruct the course of events, but they do not hand you a ready-made answer. It is up to you which leads you connect and who you ultimately hold responsible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.poster.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.webm?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/e3e10fccaa8b0581bb216e50cd59f5bd.mp4?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The analysis begins back at the office. Review case files, check photos, use the police database, and pin the most important information to the investigation board. A name, address, date, occupation, or brief mention in a report may turn out to be the missing piece of the puzzle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If something does not add up, you can return to the crime scene and examine it again. Midnight Files focuses on calm investigation, careful observation, and connecting facts instead of leading you straight to the solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is simple: identify the culprit. Each case is a separate investigation with its own victim, crime scene, evidence, and suspects. Sometimes the key lies in a well-taken photo. Sometimes in a single sentence from a report. Sometimes in information hidden deep inside the database.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.poster.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.webm?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/1010e2e04f6ea25984ec0035a88ba6dc.mp4?t=1782278981\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The truth is out there. You have to photograph it, check it, connect it, and prove it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3923680/extras/4f979bf1d1b4fbff238cbb8513a7a5df.avif?t=1782278981\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir mode</strong> - investigate Midnight City in a black-and-white style inspired by classic detective cinema</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crime scene photography</strong> - document evidence with your camera and spot details important to the case</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective's notebook</strong> - review discovered evidence, captured photos, and your own notes during the investigation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation board</strong> - pin photos, reports, notes, and suspects to organize your conclusions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Police database</strong> - check residents, addresses, events, case files, and connections between pieces of evidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evidence analysis</strong> - inspect objects, read reports, and search for details that connect people, places, and events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Return to the crime scene</strong> - revisit locations when you need to recheck a lead or fill in missing evidence</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standalone cases</strong> - each mystery is complete, independent, and built around its own set of clues</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Midnight City atmosphere</strong> - dark locations, case files, newspapers, photographs, and the classic mood of a crime investigation</p></li></ul>",
